				<h3 class="elementor-post__title">
			<a href="/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/choose-wisely-we-only-get-time-and-choice/">
				CHOOSE WISELY — WE ONLY GET TIME AND CHOICE			</a>
		</h3>
				<div class="elementor-post__excerpt">
			<p>As another year ends and a new one begins to emerge, one thing becomes clearer than ever: life is driven by two forces — Time and Choice.</p>
		</div>
				</div>
				</article>
				<article class="elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-13090 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-news" role="listitem">
				<a class="elementor-post__thumbnail__link" href="/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/beyondsilence/" tabindex="-1">
			<div class="elementor-post__thumbnail"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="300" height="200" src="https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/e363340d6004b23d-9214fb5886dfc64b-683be36947f58799-5aae2d9a36001990-FA91F352-CA9C-4E15-999B-0AFBC6B07123-300x200.avif" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-13091" alt="beyond-silence-men-must-speak-to-heal" title="" srcset="https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/e363340d6004b23d-9214fb5886dfc64b-683be36947f58799-5aae2d9a36001990-FA91F352-CA9C-4E15-999B-0AFBC6B07123-300x200.avif 300w, https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/0174f4b920574418-4c389dbb2a988a36-ebb7e8a6548259bd-87b5c3628e2ca922-FA91F352-CA9C-4E15-999B-0AFBC6B07123-1024x683.avif 1024w, https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/eb890ce69740612e-dcb776ec0294def4-65a0a3a0767b9e20-d519e41d2ecf9b2d-FA91F352-CA9C-4E15-999B-0AFBC6B07123-768x512.avif 768w, https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/9af5538baab8e99f-411a01e091f83560-c1b355157b28ac5c-309d20baad0129f0-FA91F352-CA9C-4E15-999B-0AFBC6B07123-600x400.avif 600w, https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/0466547222d75671-84b1940fd3cad6cc-46eb72a37fad8e7b-0243b39448017134-FA91F352-CA9C-4E15-999B-0AFBC6B07123.avif 1536w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></div>
		</a>
				<div class="elementor-post__text">
				<h3 class="elementor-post__title">
			<a href="/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/beyondsilence/">
				Beyond Silence: Men Must Speak to Heal			</a>
		</h3>
				<div class="elementor-post__excerpt">
			<p>This post unpacks the deep cultural roots behind this silence, the heavy toll it takes, and how therapy, grounded in the African experience, creates a safe space for men to unlearn, unpack, and heal.</p>
		</div>
				</div>
				</article>
				<article class="elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-13056 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-news" role="listitem">
				<a class="elementor-post__thumbnail__link" href="/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/whymarriagedoesnotwork/" tabindex="-1">
			<div class="elementor-post__thumbnail"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="300" height="200" src="https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/74fcc82c75b1eb30-e4ab5b5c6c34b0b3-5529e40e2fac90f3-ab1175e9903654e9-istockphoto-147002017-612x612-1-300x200.avif" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-13058" alt="marriage-of-black-couple" title="" srcset="https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/74fcc82c75b1eb30-e4ab5b5c6c34b0b3-5529e40e2fac90f3-ab1175e9903654e9-istockphoto-147002017-612x612-1-300x200.avif 300w, https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/2b33a7a43fc93d82-9532ad9c64adc8be-21a02049cad70632-3ee11bd9e80ff855-istockphoto-147002017-612x612-1-600x400.avif 600w, https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/927b1b1a64d93148-23f4fa6870be3cd4-cd47f338750ed6d4-01c88334b8515528-istockphoto-147002017-612x612-1.avif 612w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></div>
		</a>
				<div class="elementor-post__text">
				<h3 class="elementor-post__title">
			<a href="/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/whymarriagedoesnotwork/">
				Why Marriage Does Not Work			</a>
		</h3>
				<div class="elementor-post__excerpt">
			<p>There’s a growing narrative, whispered in private circles and echoed on social media platforms: “Marriage is outdated.” But here’s the truth—marriage isn’t dead;</p>
		</div>
