		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-62c188a5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="62c188a5" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-12c9971e elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-featured-image elementor-widget-image" data-id="12c9971e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="theme-post-featured-image.default">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" src="https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/8302687820e5a4db-c47b25cc66f0be75-4a6f5e3f3e114039-istockphoto-1410236100-612x612-1-600x400.jpg" class="attachment-tenweb_optimizer_mobile size-tenweb_optimizer_mobile wp-image-6230" alt="young-black-couple-traumatized" srcset="https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/8302687820e5a4db-c47b25cc66f0be75-4a6f5e3f3e114039-istockphoto-1410236100-612x612-1-600x400.jpg 600w, https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/0c5fae5c9e26b352-84c28673aa6ab757-f101b93fe180db98-istockphoto-1410236100-612x612-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/bb40676a6a859736-6660103698ce6595-d3e14ef3737deaeb-istockphoto-1410236100-612x612-1.jpg 612w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" title="">															</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7065acdd e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="7065acdd" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7fb4d474 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="7fb4d474" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1c8c427 elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-post-info" data-id="1c8c427" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="post-info.default">
							<ul class="elementor-inline-items elementor-icon-list-items elementor-post-info">
								<li class="elementor-icon-list-item elementor-repeater-item-fde9fb9 elementor-inline-item" itemprop="datePublished">
						<a href="/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/2023/05/03/">
														<span class="elementor-icon-list-text elementor-post-info__item elementor-post-info__item--type-date">
										<time>May 3, 2023</time>					</span>
									</a>
				</li>
				<li class="elementor-icon-list-item elementor-repeater-item-f7bd4a7 elementor-inline-item" itemprop="author">
						<a href="/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/author/user6387319d7ccb0/">
														<span class="elementor-icon-list-text elementor-post-info__item elementor-post-info__item--type-author">
										Talk Space					</span>
									</a>
				</li>
				</ul>
						</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-45491c25 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="45491c25" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Trauma, whether it is caused by abuse, neglect, natural disasters, or other events, can have a profound effect on an individual&#8217;s mental health and ability to form and maintain healthy relationships.</p>
<p></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Trauma is not just a narrative of events that occurred. Rather, it entails the retention of feelings, beliefs, and bodily sensations that you experienced during the event. These persist as reactions in the present, not just as memories.</p>
<p></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The ability to connect with others authentically can be altered by traumatic experiences, which fundamentally change your view of the world and yourself. They affect thoughts, feelings, the nervous system, and your ability to trust, leading you to build walls, feel guided by fear, and see worst-case scenarios everywhere. <a href="https://www.gottman.com/blog/couples-and-shared-trauma-healing-together/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Unhealthy coping mechanisms</a> may develop as a result.</p>
<p></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Some common ways trauma can impact relationships include:</p>
<p></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">1. Trust issues &#8211; Trauma can create a sense of distrust in others, which can make it difficult to form close relationships.</p>
<p></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">2. Emotional detachment &#8211; Trauma survivors may struggle to connect emotionally with others, leading to a sense of isolation and loneliness.</p>
<p></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">3. Flashbacks and triggers &#8211; Trauma survivors may experience flashbacks or triggers related to their trauma, which can be difficult for partners and loved ones to understand and cope with.</p>
<p></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">4. Communication difficulties &#8211; Trauma survivors may struggle to communicate their thoughts and feelings effectively, leading to misunderstandings and conflicts in relationships.</p>
<p></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">5. Intimacy issues &#8211; Trauma can create physical and emotional barriers to intimacy, which can make it difficult for partners to connect and form meaningful relationships.</p>
<p></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Trauma can impact individuals differently, and some may experience more severe or long-lasting effects than others.</p>
<p></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Furthermore, trauma includes what you did not encounter but could have, such as unfulfilled needs or abandonment.</p>
<p></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Can you relate to any of these? Do you see a connection between your past experiences and your beliefs and fears now when it comes to relationships?</p>
<p></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">If yes, <a href="/our-services/">seeking professional help</a> from a therapist or counselor can help address the impact of trauma on relationships.</p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>								</div>
