	('108f468f-b574-4333-9be0-88ab4e788b70', 'page', 12578, 'terms-and-conditions', '/content/pages/terms-and-conditions', 'Terms and Conditions', '<p>Terms of Service This Agreement consists of the following terms and conditions (hereinafter the “General Terms”) and terms and conditions if any, specific to the use of individual or joint Services (hereinafter the “Service Specific Terms”). In the event of a conflict between the General Terms and Service, Specific Terms, the Service Specific Terms shall [&hellip;]</p>
', '<img src="https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/ab453a8e3b009f61-4fe20f712a87cc2f-4af33fef0eb6d067-b2faa49ba07ca77a-Talk-Space-1-1-768x313.png" alt="Professional-Counselling-Services-Logo" title="" width="768" height="313"><ul><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="elementor-item" href="/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/">Home</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="elementor-item" href="/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/marriage-counsellors-in-nigeria/">Our Services</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="elementor-item" href="/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/counseling-services/">About us</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="elementor-item" href="/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/blogs/">Blogs</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="elementor-item" href="/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/contact-08099931039-for-professional-guidance-and-support/">Contacts</a></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="elementor-item" href="/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/">Home</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="elementor-item" href="/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/marriage-counsellors-in-nigeria/">Our Services</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="elementor-item" href="/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/counseling-services/">About us</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="elementor-item" href="/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/blogs/">Blogs</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="elementor-item" href="/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/contact-08099931039-for-professional-guidance-and-support/">Contacts</a></p></li></ul><h3>Terms of Service</h3><p>This Agreement consists of the following terms and conditions (hereinafter the “General Terms”) and terms and conditions, if any, specific to the use of individual or joint Services (hereinafter the “Service Specific Terms”). In the event of a conflict between the General Terms and Service and the Specific Terms, the Specific Terms shall prevail.</p><h3>Acceptance of the Agreement</h3><p>You must be of legal age to enter into a binding agreement to accept the Agreement. If you do not agree to the General Terms, do not use any of our Services. If you agree to the General Terms and do not agree to any Service Specific Terms, do not use the corresponding Service. You can accept the Agreement by checking a checkbox or clicking a button indicating your acceptance, or by actually using the Services.</p><h3>Description of Service</h3><p>Therapy, or counseling, is&nbsp;a confidential process where a client works with a trained professional in a safe environment to explore their thoughts, feelings, and behaviors.&nbsp;The goal is to help the client better understand themselves and others, identify areas for change, and develop coping mechanisms. It is a professional relationship between you and a trained counsellor/therapist who has the desire, willingness, and adherence to professional codes of conduct and ethics to help you accomplish your individual or relationship goals.</p><p>Counselling/therapy involves sharing sensitive, personal, and private information that may be distressing at times. During counselling, there <strong>MAY</strong> be periods of increased anxiety. The outcome of counselling is often positive; however, the level of satisfaction for any individual is unpredictable. Your counsellor is available to support you throughout the entire process.</p><h3>Confidentiality</h3><p>All interactions with <strong>Talk Space Counselling Services, including scheduling or attendance at appointments, the content of your sessions, progress in counselling</strong>, and your records, are <strong>confidential</strong>. No counselling record is contained in any academic, educational, or job placement file.</p><p>You may require the Counsellor/Talk Space Counselling Services to&nbsp;release specific information about your sessions to persons you designate.</p><p>The Counsellor works as part of a team, and as such, case files may be reviewed with the team members, but the client’s name and other identifying details will not be used in these sessions.</p><p>The Counsellor/<strong>Talk Space Counselling Services</strong> bears no responsibility for confidential information divulged by the client knowingly or inadvertently. The client is also responsible for keeping information about their session confidential, offline and online.</p><h3>Exceptions to Confidentiality</h3><ul><li><p>The Counsellor/<strong>Talk Space Counselling Services</strong> is required by the Court of Law to release information about the client’s</p></li><li><p>If there is a possibility of miscarriage of</p></li><li><p>Suspicion/Detection or Disclosure of Physical abuse, sexual abuse, or neglect of any person under the age of 18 years.</p></li><li><p>If Suicidal or Homicidal tendencies are</p></li><li><p>If Client is at risk of causing serious injury or harm to self or another</p></li><li><p>If the Client authorizes the Counsellor/<strong>Talk Space Counselling Services</strong> to release information</p></li></ul><h3>Length of Sessions, Overtime &amp; Counselling Packages</h3><p>Counselling is offered for 50 minutes per session for individual therapy or 75 minutes per session for couples therapy, and can be delivered virtually or in person. Session timing does not cover overtime, which will be prorated and charged to the client.</p><p>Counselling packages are offered in bouquets of 4, 6, and 10 sessions after the first session. The maximum time of use for each bouquet is twice the selected bouquet''s duration. For instance, a 4- 4-session bouquet <strong><u>MUST</u></strong> be completed within 8 weeks. Failure to use the bouquet within the period will result in forfeiture of any remaining sessions, except under extenuating circumstances.</p><h3>Extenuating Circumstances</h3><p>Suppose the client cannot use sessions within the period specified above. In that case, extenuating circumstances allow a maximum period of 6 months or until December 20th of the calendar year in which the session is booked (<strong>whichever comes first</strong>). Failure to use sessions within the period will result in forfeiture of any outstanding sessions.</p><h3>Abusive or Threatening Behaviors</h3><p>Abusive or threatening behavior by the Client or the Counselor is unacceptable. The Counsellor/<strong>Talk Space Counselling Services</strong> reserves the right to withdraw services if the Client becomes abusive or threatening.</p><h3>Rescheduling of Sessions</h3><p>Both the Counselor and Client are expected to give as much notice as possible if either is unable to attend a session. If a session is to be rescheduled, a 48-hour notice should be given. Cancellation with less than 48 hours’ notice will lead to forfeiture of 50% of the payment. Failure of the client to attend a session without notice will result in full forfeiture of the payment made.</p><h3>Cancellations &amp; Refunds</h3><p>Refunds for sessions can ONLY be requested within 1 week of payment AND with at least a 5-day notice before the session date. Refunds requested within this period will be processed to the client less a 10% administrative charge. Cancellation with less than 5 days’ notice will lead to forfeiture of 50% of the payment made. Failure by the client to attend a session without notice will result in full forfeiture of the payment made.</p><p>Aside from the above, payments are nonrefundable, but sessions are transferable (the client can give/gift the session to someone else).</p><p>I understand the risks and benefits of counselling, the nature and limits of confidentiality, and what is expected of me as a client during counselling. I also confirm that I am not under any duress or form of extortion to partake in the sessions.</p><p>“The points above are understood, and I agree to work with the assigned counsellor within the terms of this contract.”</p><p></p>', 'publish', '2024-11-24 16:10:21+00', '2026-07-20 06:29:00.264+00', 'Talk Space', NULL, '{"source": "wordpress-rest-api", "tag_ids": [], "author_id": 7648, "category_ids": [], "wordpress_id": 12578, "media_imported": true, "featured_media_id": 0}', '2026-07-15 07:20:22.522702+00', '2026-07-20 06:29:00.550346+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('64b2166f-8092-4de7-8ef0-52d8bffec0b2', 'page', 1787366594983, 'therapists', '/therapists', 'Therapists', '<p>Meet Talk Space''s licensed Nigerian therapists and counsellors, with online and in-person support.</p>', NULL, 'publish', '2026-08-22 02:44:46.411+00', '2026-08-22 02:43:14.983+00', NULL, NULL, '{"sections": [{"id": "therapists-hero", "body": "Every Talk Space therapist is licensed to practise in Nigeria and holds training in psychology, counselling or a related clinical field. Our care coordinators match you with the therapist whose training and style best fit.", "type": "hero", "align": "center", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "links": [{"id": "therapists-hero-book", "href": "/book", "label": "Request a session", "variant": "primary"}, {"id": "therapists-hero-contact", "href": "/contact", "label": "Ask for a match", "variant": "outline"}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "Meet the team", "heading": "Licensed, warm, and", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "cream", "headingAfter": ".", "headingEmphasis": "quietly excellent"}, {"id": "therapists-live", "body": "", "type": "therapistList", "align": "left", "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "", "heading": "", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "therapists-cta", "body": "Beyond the profiles above, Talk Space partners with a vetted network of licensed therapists across Nigeria.", "type": "cta", "align": "center", "links": [{"id": "therapists-cta-book", "href": "/book", "label": "Book a session", "variant": "primary"}, {"id": "therapists-cta-contact", "href": "/contact", "label": "Talk to us first", "variant": "outline"}], "width": "content", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "", "heading": "More clinicians, matched to you on request.", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "cream"}]}', '2026-08-22 02:43:14.983+00', '2026-08-22 02:44:46.510394+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('3d3d8cd0-4919-4d53-ae18-de59b90a219e', 'page', 1785815199022, 'contact', '/contact', 'Contact us', '<p>Reach Talk Space by WhatsApp, phone or email. Offices in Lagos and Abuja, Mon-Fri 9am-5pm WAT.</p>', NULL, 'publish', '2026-08-22 02:44:47.321+00', '2026-08-04 03:46:39.022+00', NULL, NULL, '{"sections": [{"id": "contact-hero", "body": "Our care team responds within one working day. If you are in a crisis right now, please see our emergency support page.", "type": "hero", "align": "center", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "links": [{"id": "contact-hero-emergency", "href": "/emergency-support", "label": "Emergency support", "variant": "outline"}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "Get in touch", "heading": "A calm place to", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "cream", "headingAfter": ".", "headingEmphasis": "reach us"}, {"id": "contact-channels", "body": "", "type": "cardGrid", "align": "left", "cards": [{"id": "contact-whatsapp", "body": "+234 704 846 9090", "href": "https://wa.me/2347048469090", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "WhatsApp", "bullets": [], "tagline": "Fastest response · Mon-Fri, 9am-5pm", "linkLabel": "Open in WhatsApp"}, {"id": "contact-phone", "body": "+234 809 993 1039", "href": "tel:+2348099931039", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Phone (Nigeria)", "bullets": [], "tagline": "Mon-Fri, 9am-5pm WAT", "linkLabel": "Call now"}, {"id": "contact-email", "body": "hello@talkspace.ng", "href": "mailto:hello@talkspace.ng", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Email", "bullets": [], "tagline": "Replies within one working day", "linkLabel": "Send an email"}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "columns": 3, "eyebrow": "", "heading": "", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "contact-offices", "body": "", "type": "cardGrid", "align": "left", "cards": [{"id": "contact-abuja", "body": "Plot 153A, T-Pumpy Estate\nOpp. NIU Estate, Off Saburi 1, FCT, Abuja", "href": "", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Abuja (FCT)", "bullets": ["In-person sessions by appointment only."], "tagline": "", "linkLabel": ""}, {"id": "contact-lagos", "body": "20, Estaport Avenue\nGbagada, Lagos, Nigeria", "href": "", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Lagos", "bullets": ["In-person sessions by appointment only."], "tagline": "", "linkLabel": ""}, {"id": "contact-hours", "body": "", "href": "", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Hours", "bullets": ["Monday to Friday: 9:00 to 17:00", "Saturday: By appointment", "Sunday: Closed"], "tagline": "", "linkLabel": ""}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "columns": 3, "eyebrow": "", "heading": "", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "contact-form", "body": "We reply within one working day. For emergencies, please use our crisis resources.", "type": "contactForm", "align": "left", "width": "content", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "Send a message", "heading": "Tell us what you need.", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "page"}]}', '2026-08-04 03:46:39.022+00', '2026-08-22 02:44:47.40669+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('ca2edd45-5a0e-48c4-9aeb-007c8bf27389', 'page', 1785814955397, 'terms', '/terms', 'Terms of Service', '<p>The terms that govern your use of Talk Space Counselling Services.</p>', NULL, 'publish', '2026-08-22 02:44:48.241+00', '2026-08-04 03:42:35.397+00', NULL, NULL, '{"sections": [{"id": "terms-hero", "body": "Last updated: 1 January 2026", "type": "hero", "align": "left", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "links": [], "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "Legal", "heading": "Terms of Service", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "page", "headingAfter": "", "headingEmphasis": ""}, {"id": "terms-about", "html": "<p>These terms govern your use of Talk Space Counselling Services (“Talk Space”). By booking a session or using our website you agree to them. If you do not agree, please do not use the service.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "About these terms", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "terms-emergency", "html": "<p>Talk Space is not a crisis or emergency service. If you or someone you know is at immediate risk, call 112 or use the numbers on our emergency support page.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Not an emergency service", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "terms-who", "html": "<p>You must be 18 or over to book for yourself. Sessions for minors (13-17) must be booked by a parent or legal guardian, who will sign our consent forms.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Who can use Talk Space", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "terms-payment", "html": "<p>Fees are shown on our pricing page and confirmed before your session. Payment is taken only after your session is confirmed. Sliding-scale slots are limited and awarded at our discretion.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Sessions and payment", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "terms-cancellations", "html": "<p>You can reschedule up to 24 hours before your session at no charge. Please see our cancellation and refund policy for the full detail.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Cancellations and refunds", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "terms-responsibilities", "html": "<p>You agree to give accurate information at booking, to attend sessions in an environment where you feel safe and undisturbed, and to not record sessions without your therapist''s consent.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Your responsibilities", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "terms-liability", "html": "<p>Talk Space provides counselling but cannot guarantee specific outcomes. Our liability for loss arising from use of the service is limited to fees paid in the twelve months before the event giving rise to the claim.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Limitation of liability", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "terms-law", "html": "<p>These terms are governed by the laws of the Federal Republic of Nigeria. Disputes are subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Lagos State.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Governing law", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}]}', '2026-08-04 03:42:35.397+00', '2026-08-22 02:44:48.329998+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('5dc13876-2688-4a5b-b163-d2c492a91869', 'post', 52, 'the-romantic-benefits-of-covid-19', '/content/posts/the-romantic-benefits-of-covid-19', 'The Romantic Benefits of Covid-19', '<p>The casualties of coronavirus are not only those that contracted the disease but also those who are living with the fear.</p>
