				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2ee72fcc elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-featured-image elementor-widget-image" data-id="2ee72fcc" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="theme-post-featured-image.default">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="612" height="408" src="https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/e1ff2b5f5e6985a3-10bde8bdb0cac2c8-ffd0c8afa91fcd5c-877312c4b53d7dae-istockphoto-1328878155-612x612-1.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-5875" alt="black-couple-sitting-together-in-counselor-office-in-forgiveness-therapy" srcset="https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/e1ff2b5f5e6985a3-10bde8bdb0cac2c8-ffd0c8afa91fcd5c-877312c4b53d7dae-istockphoto-1328878155-612x612-1.jpg 612w, https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/94a530e48803b866-516c83330b5633eb-3d6431ba78be67bd-875ccaadf15eb9f5-istockphoto-1328878155-612x612-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/e8cc40cee712da23-25449d3ea46f0b74-73fe73412525ffac-f809bd691f871394-istockphoto-1328878155-612x612-1-600x400.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 612px) 100vw, 612px" title="">															</div>
