(FCT)", "bullets": ["In-person sessions by appointment only."], "tagline": "", "linkLabel": ""}, {"id": "contact-lagos", "body": "20, Estaport Avenue\nGbagada, Lagos, Nigeria", "href": "", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Lagos", "bullets": ["In-person sessions by appointment only."], "tagline": "", "linkLabel": ""}, {"id": "contact-hours", "body": "", "href": "", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Hours", "bullets": ["Monday to Friday: 9:00 to 17:00", "Saturday: By appointment", "Sunday: Closed"], "tagline": "", "linkLabel": ""}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "columns": 3, "eyebrow": "", "heading": "", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "contact-form", "body": "We reply within one working day. For emergencies, please use our crisis resources.", "type": "contactForm", "align": "left", "width": "content", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "Send a message", "heading": "Tell us what you need.", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "page"}]}, "body_html": null, "source_id": 1785815199022, "updated_at": "2026-08-22T02:43:15.913491+00:00", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null, "author_name": null, "imported_at": "2026-08-04T03:46:39.022+00:00", "excerpt_html": "<p>Reach Talk Space by WhatsApp, phone or email. Offices in Lagos and Abuja, Mon-Fri 9am-5pm WAT.</p>", "published_at": "2026-08-22T02:43:15.838+00:00", "source_status": "publish", "canonical_path": "/contact", "source_modified_at": "2026-08-04T03:46:39.022+00:00", "featured_media_path": null, "scheduled_publish_at": null, "scheduled_unpublish_at": null}', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-22 02:43:15.913491+00'),
	('8ae8c148-b4b9-43c1-9c7b-129edae6c327', 'content_entry', 'a89147be-0f7f-4679-bcd1-e6e15accff93', 'update', '{"id": "a89147be-0f7f-4679-bcd1-e6e15accff93", "kind": "page", "slug": "privacy-policy", "title": "Privacy Policy", "metadata": {"source": "wordpress-rest-api", "tag_ids": [], "sections": [{"id": "privacy-hero", "body": "Last updated: 1 January 2026", "type": "hero", "align": "left", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "links": [], "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "Legal", "heading": "Privacy Policy", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "page", "headingAfter": "", "headingEmphasis": ""}, {"id": "privacy-who", "html": "<p>Talk Space Counselling Services Ltd (“Talk Space”, “we”, “us”) is a Nigerian mental-health provider registered in Lagos. This policy explains how we handle your personal and health information under the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023 (NDPA).</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Who we are", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "privacy-collect", "html": "<p>We collect the details you share when booking or attending a session (name, contact details, brief clinical notes), technical information from our website (device, IP, cookies for essential functionality), and payment references from our payment processor. We do not collect payment card numbers directly.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "What we collect", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "privacy-use", "html": "<p>We use your information to deliver the counselling you have asked for, to schedule and bill sessions, to keep clinical records as required by professional standards, and to respond when you contact us. Aggregated, de-identified data may be used to improve our services.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "How we use it", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "privacy-confidentiality", "html": "<p>Sessions are private and protected by professional ethics. We only share information with your explicit consent, or where required by law, for example, a real and imminent risk to life, or a valid court order. Where possible, we tell you first.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Confidentiality", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "privacy-protect", "html": "<p>We use encrypted video, encrypted storage and role-based access. Clinical notes are accessible only to your therapist and, where needed for care, a named clinical supervisor. Staff are trained on data protection annually.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "How we protect it", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "privacy-rights", "html": "<p>You can ask us for a copy of the personal data we hold about you, correct anything inaccurate, withdraw consent, or ask us to delete data we no longer need to keep. Email privacy@talkspace.ng and we will respond within 30 days.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Your rights", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "privacy-contact", "html": "<p>Questions about this policy? Email privacy@talkspace.ng or write to the Data Protection Officer, Talk Space Counselling Services, 20, Estaport Avenue, Gbagada, Lagos.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Contact", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}], "author_id": 7648, "category_ids": [], "wordpress_id": 85, "media_imported": true, "featured_media_id": 0}, "body_html": "<img src=\"https://vwupdobwjlmitsgasdrz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-media/bc716f732d0a4af6-6eb146f98f2fe1a0-ab453a8e3b009f61-4fe20f712a87cc2f-4af33fef0eb6d067-b2faa49ba07ca77a-Talk-Space-1-1-768x313.png\" alt=\"Professional-Counselling-Services-Logo\" title=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"313\"><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"elementor-item\" href=\"/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/\">Home</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"elementor-item\" href=\"/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/marriage-counsellors-in-nigeria/\">Our Services</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"elementor-item\" href=\"/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/counseling-services/\">About us</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"elementor-item\" href=\"/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/blogs/\">Blogs</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"elementor-item\" href=\"/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/contact-08099931039-for-professional-guidance-and-support/\">Contacts</a></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"elementor-item\" href=\"/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/\">Home</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"elementor-item\" href=\"/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/marriage-counsellors-in-nigeria/\">Our Services</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"elementor-item\" href=\"/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/counseling-services/\">About us</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"elementor-item\" href=\"/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/blogs/\">Blogs</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"elementor-item\" href=\"/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/contact-08099931039-for-professional-guidance-and-support/\">Contacts</a></p></li></ul><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"/content/pages/professional-counseling-services\">Talk Space Counselling Services</a></p><p>Email: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"mailto:email@\">admin@talkspace.ng</a></p><p>Address:</p><p>PLOT A153, T-PUMPY ESTATE, KABA FCT, Abuja 900105</p><p>Hours:</p><p>Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, Friday, Saturday, Sunday 10:00 – 17:00</p><p>Customer Service: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"tel:+2348099931039\">+2348099931039</a></p><p>Privacy Policy</p><p>Last updated: July 20, 2026</p><p>This Privacy Policy describes our policies and procedures on the collection, use, and disclosure of your information when you use the Service and tells you about your privacy rights and how the law protects you.</p><p>We use Your Personal data to provide and improve the Service. By using the Service, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this Privacy Policy. This Privacy Policy has been created with the help of the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" href=\"https://www.privacypolicies.com/privacy-policy-generator/\">Privacy Policy Generator</a>.</p><h2>Interpretation and Definitions</h2><h3>Interpretation</h3><p>The words of which the initial letter is capitalized have meanings defined under the following conditions. The following definitions shall have the same meaning regardless of whether they appear in singular or plural.</p><h3>Definitions</h3><p>For the purposes of this Privacy Policy:</p><p><strong>Account</strong> means a unique account created for you to access our Service or any part of it.</p><p><strong>Affiliate</strong> means an entity that controls, is controlled by, or is under common control with a party, where “control” means ownership of 50% or more of the shares, equity interest, or other securities entitled to vote for the election of directors or other managing authority.</p><p><strong>Company</strong> (referred to as either “the Company”, “We”, “Us” or “Our” in this Agreement) refers to Talk Space Counselling Services, CRM Complex, Block D, Suites 5 &amp; 6, Redemption Camp, Ogun State.</p><p><strong>Cookies</strong> are small files that are placed on Your computer, mobile device, or any other device by a website, containing the details of Your browsing history on that website among its many uses.</p><p><strong>Country</strong> refers to: Nigeria</p><p><strong>Device</strong> means any device that can access the Service, such as a computer, a cellphone, or a digital tablet.</p><p><strong>Personal Data</strong> is any information that relates to an identified or identifiable individual.</p><p><strong>Service</strong> refers to the Website.</p><p><strong>Service Provider</strong> means any natural or legal person who processes the data on behalf of the Company. It refers to third-party companies or individuals employed by the Company to facilitate the Service, to provide the Service on behalf of the Company, to perform services related to the Service, or to assist the Company in analyzing how the Service is used.</p><p><strong>Usage Data</strong> refers to data collected automatically, either generated by the use of the Service or from the Service infrastructure itself (for example, the duration of a page visit).</p><p><strong>Website</strong> refers to Talk Space Counselling Services, accessible from <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"/content/pages/professional-counseling-services\">/content/pages/professional-counseling-services</a></p><p><strong>You</strong> means the individual accessing or using the Service, or the company, or other legal entity on behalf of which such individual is accessing or using the Service, as applicable.</p><h2>Collecting and Using Your Personal Data</h2><h3>Types of Data Collected</h3><p>Personal Data</p><p>While using Our Service, we may ask you to provide us with certain personally identifiable information that can be used to contact or identify you. Personally identifiable information may include, but is not limited to:</p><p>Email address</p><p>First name and last name</p><p>Phone number</p><p>Usage Data</p><p>Usage Data</p><p>Usage Data is collected automatically when using the Service.</p><p>Usage Data may include information such as Your Device’s Internet Protocol address (e.g., IP address), browser type, browser version, the pages of our Service that you visit, the time and date of your visit, the time spent on those pages, unique device identifiers, and other diagnostic data.</p><p>When you access the Service by or through a mobile device, we may collect certain information automatically, including, but not limited to, the type of mobile device you use, your mobile device’s unique ID, the IP address of your mobile device, your mobile operating system, the type of mobile Internet browser you use, unique device identifiers, and other diagnostic data.</p><p>We may also collect information that your browser sends whenever you visit our Service or access the Service via a mobile device.</p><p>Tracking Technologies and Cookies</p><p>We use Cookies and similar tracking technologies to track the activity on Our Service and store certain information. Tracking technologies used are beacons, tags, and scripts to collect and track information and to improve and analyze Our Service. The technologies we use may include:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Cookies or Browser Cookies.</strong> A cookie is a small file placed on Your Device. You can instruct your browser to refuse all Cookies or to indicate when a Cookie is being sent. However, if you do not accept Cookies, you may not be able to use some parts of our Service. Unless you have adjusted your browser settings so that it will refuse cookies, our Service may use Cookies.</p></li><li><p><strong>Web Beacons.</strong> Certain sections of our Service and our emails may contain small electronic files known as web beacons (also referred to as clear gifs, pixel tags, and single-pixel gifs) that permit the Company, for example, to count users who have visited those pages or opened an email and for other related website statistics (for example, recording the popularity of a certain section and verifying system and server integrity).</p></li></ul><p>Cookies can be “Persistent” or “Session” Cookies. Persistent Cookies remain on your personal computer or mobile device when you go offline, while Session Cookies are deleted as soon as you close your web browser. Learn more about cookies on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" href=\"https://www.privacypolicies.com/blog/privacy-policy-template/#Use_Of_Cookies_Log_Files_And_Tracking\">Privacy Policies website</a> article.</p><p>We use both Session and Persistent Cookies for the purposes set out below:</p><p><strong>Necessary / Essential Cookies</strong></p><p>Type: Session Cookies</p><p>Administered by: Us</p><p>Purpose: These Cookies are essential to provide you with services available through the Website and to enable you to use some of its features. They help to authenticate users and prevent fraudulent use of user accounts. Without these Cookies, the services that you have asked for cannot be provided, and we only use these Cookies to provide you with those services.</p><p><strong>Cookies Policy / Notice Acceptance Cookies</strong></p><p>Type: Persistent Cookies</p><p>Administered by: Us</p><p>Purpose: These Cookies identify if users have accepted the use of cookies on the Website.</p><p><strong>Functionality Cookies</strong></p><p>Type: Persistent Cookies</p><p>Administered by: Us</p><p>Purpose: These Cookies allow us to remember choices you make when you use the Website, such as remembering your login details or language preference. The purpose of these Cookies is to provide you with a more personalized experience and to prevent you from having to re-enter your preferences every time you use the Website.</p><p>For more information about the cookies we use and your choices regarding cookies, please visit our Cookies Policy or the Cookies section of our Privacy Policy.</p><h3>Use of Your Personal Data</h3><p>The Company may use Personal Data for the following purposes:</p><p><strong>To provide and maintain our Service</strong>, including monitoring the usage of our Service.</p><p><strong>To manage Your Account:</strong> to manage your registration as a user of the Service. The Personal Data You provide may grant You access to certain functionalities of the Service available to You as a registered user.</p><p><strong>For the performance of a contract:</strong> the development, compliance, and undertaking of the purchase contract for the products, items, or services you have purchased or of any other contract with Us through the Service.</p><p><strong>To contact You:</strong> To contact You by email, telephone calls, SMS, or other equivalent forms of electronic communication, such as a mobile application’s push notifications regarding updates or informative communications related to the functionalities, products, or contracted services, including the security updates, when necessary or reasonable for their implementation.</p><p><strong>To provide you with news, special offers, and general information about other goods, services, and events that we offer that are similar to those that you have already purchased or enquired about, unless you have opted not to receive such information</strong>.</p><p><strong>To manage Your requests:</strong> To attend and manage Your requests to Us.</p><p><strong>For business transfers:</strong> We may use Your information to evaluate or conduct a merger, divestiture, restructuring, reorganization, dissolution, or other sale or transfer of some or all of our assets, whether as a going concern or as part of bankruptcy, liquidation, or similar proceeding, in which Personal Data held by Us about our Service users is among the assets transferred.</p><p><strong>For other purposes</strong>: We may use your information for other purposes, such as data analysis, identifying usage trends, determining the effectiveness of our promotional campaigns, and evaluating and improving our Service, products, services, marketing, and your experience.</p><p>We may share your personal information in the following situations:</p><ul><li><p><strong>With Service Providers:</strong> We may share your personal information with Service Providers to monitor and analyze the use of our Service, and to contact you.</p></li><li><p><strong>For business transfers:</strong> We may share or transfer Your personal information in connection with, or during negotiations of, any merger, sale of Company assets, financing, or acquisition of all or a portion of Our business to another company.</p></li><li><p><strong>With Affiliates:</strong> We may share Your information with Our affiliates, in which case we will require those affiliates to honor this Privacy Policy. Affiliates include our parent company and any other subsidiaries, joint venture partners, or other companies that we control or that are under common control with Us.</p></li><li><p><strong>With business partners:</strong> We may share your information with our business partners to offer you certain products, services, or promotions.</p></li><li><p><strong>With other users:</strong> when you share personal information or otherwise interact in the public areas with other users, such information may be viewed by all users and may be publicly distributed outside.</p></li><li><p><strong>With Your consent</strong>: We may disclose Your personal information for any other purpose with Your consent.</p></li></ul><h3>Retention of Your Personal Data</h3><p>The Company will retain Your Personal Data only for as long as is necessary for the purposes set out in this Privacy Policy. We will retain and use Your Personal Data to the extent necessary to comply with our legal obligations (for example, if we are required to retain your data under applicable laws), resolve disputes, and enforce our legal agreements and policies.</p><p>The Company will also retain Usage Data for internal analysis purposes. Usage Data is generally retained for a shorter period, except when it is used to strengthen security or improve the functionality of Our Service, or when we are legally obligated to retain it for longer periods.</p><h3>Transfer of Your Personal Data</h3><p>Your information, including Personal Data, is processed at the Company’s operating offices and in any other places where the parties involved in the processing are located. It means that this information may be transferred to — and maintained on — computers located outside of Your state, province, country, or other governmental jurisdiction where the data protection laws may differ from those in Your jurisdiction.</p><p>Your consent to this Privacy Policy, followed by Your submission of such information, represents Your agreement to that transfer.</p><p>The Company will take all steps reasonably necessary to ensure that Your data is treated securely and in accordance with this Privacy Policy, and no transfer of Your Personal Data will take place to an organization or a country unless there are adequate controls in place, including the security of Your data and other personal information.</p><h3>Delete Your Personal Data</h3><p>You have the right to delete or request that We assist in deleting the Personal Data that We have collected about You.</p><p>Our Service may give You the ability to delete certain information about You from within the Service.</p><p>You may update, amend, or delete your information at any time by signing in to Your Account if you have one, and visiting the account settings section that allows you to manage your personal information. You may also contact us to request access to, correct, or delete any personal information that you have provided to Us.</p><p>Please note, however, that We may need to retain certain information when we have a legal obligation or lawful basis to do so.</p><h3>Disclosure of Your Personal Data</h3><p>Business Transactions</p><p>If the Company is involved in a merger, acquisition, or asset sale, your Personal Data may be transferred. We will provide notice before Your Personal Data is transferred and becomes subject to a different Privacy Policy.</p><p>Law enforcement</p><p>Under certain circumstances, the Company may be required to disclose Your Personal Data if required by law or in response to valid requests from public authorities (e.g., a court or a government agency).</p><p>Other legal requirements</p><p>The Company may disclose Your Personal Data in good faith belief that such action is necessary to:</p><ul><li><p>Comply with a legal obligation</p></li><li><p>Protect and defend the rights or property of the Company</p></li><li><p>Prevent or investigate possible wrongdoing in connection with the Service</p></li><li><p>Protect the personal safety of Users of the Service or the public</p></li><li><p>Protect against legal liability</p></li></ul><h3>Security of Your Personal Data</h3><p>The security of Your Personal Data is important to Us, but remember that no method of transmission over the Internet or of electronic storage is 100% secure. While we strive to use commercially acceptable means to protect Your Personal Data, we cannot guarantee its absolute security.</p><h2>Detailed Information on the Processing of Your Personal Data</h2><p>The Service Providers We use may have access to Your Personal Data. These third-party vendors collect, store, use, process, and transfer information about your activity on Our Service in accordance with their Privacy Policies.</p><h3>Usage, Performance, and Miscellaneous</h3><p>We may use third-party Service Providers to maintain and improve our Service.</p><p><strong>Google Places</strong></p><p>Google Places is a service that returns information about places using HTTP requests. It is operated by Google</p><p>Google Places service may collect information from you and from Your Device for security purposes.</p><p>The information gathered by Google Places is held in accordance with the Privacy Policy of Google: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" href=\"https://www.google.com/intl/en/policies/privacy/\">https://www.google.com/intl/en/policies/privacy/</a></p><h2>Children’s Privacy</h2><p>Our Service does not address anyone under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from anyone under the age of 13. If you are a parent or guardian and you are aware that your child has provided us with Personal Data, please contact us. If we become aware that we have collected Personal Data from anyone under the age of 13 without verification of parental consent, we take steps to remove that information from our servers.</p><p>If we need to rely on consent as a legal basis for processing your information and your country requires consent from a parent, we may require your parent’s consent before we collect and use that information.</p><h2>Links to Other Websites</h2><p>Our Service may contain links to other websites that are not operated by Us. If you click on a third-party link, you will be directed to that third-party’s site. We strongly advise you to review the Privacy Policy of every site you visit.</p><p>We have no control over and assume no responsibility for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party sites or services.</p><h2>Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2><p>We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page.</p><p>We will let you know via email and/or a prominent notice on Our Service, prior to the change becoming effective, and update the “Last updated” date at the top of this Privacy Policy.</p><p>You are advised to review this Privacy Policy periodically for any changes. Changes to this Privacy Policy are effective when they are posted on this page.</p><h2>Contact Us</h2><p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact us:</p><p>By email: admin@talkspace.ng</p><p>By visiting this page on our website: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/contact-08099931039-for-professional-guidance-and-support/\">/content/pages/professional-counseling-services/contact-08099931039-for-professional-guidance-and-support/</a></p><p>By phone number: +2347048469090</p><p></p>", "source_id": 85, "updated_at": "2026-08-22T02:43:16.334841+00:00", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null, "author_name": "Talk Space", "imported_at": "2026-07-15T07:20:22.522702+00:00", "excerpt_html": "<p>How Talk Space collects, uses and protects your personal and clinical information.</p>", "published_at": "2026-08-22T02:43:16.239+00:00", "source_status": "publish", "canonical_path": "/privacy-policy", "source_modified_at": "2026-07-20T06:40:04.379+00:00", "featured_media_path": null, "scheduled_publish_at": null, "scheduled_unpublish_at": null}', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-22 02:43:16.334841+00'),
	('28717c17-d677-4d5c-aa4a-11cf0e1ab207', 'content_entry', 'ca2edd45-5a0e-48c4-9aeb-007c8bf27389', 'update', '{"id": "ca2edd45-5a0e-48c4-9aeb-007c8bf27389", "kind": "page", "slug": "terms", "title": "Terms of Service", "metadata": {"sections": [{"id": "terms-hero", "body": "Last updated: 1 January 2026", "type": "hero", "align": "left", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "links": [], "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "Legal", "heading": "Terms of Service", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "page", "headingAfter": "", "headingEmphasis": ""}, {"id": "terms-about", "html": "<p>These terms govern your use of Talk Space Counselling Services (“Talk Space”). By booking a session or using our website you agree to them. If you do not agree, please do not use the service.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "About these terms", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "terms-emergency", "html": "<p>Talk Space is not a crisis or emergency service. If you or someone you know is at immediate risk, call 112 or use the numbers on our emergency support page.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Not an emergency service", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "terms-who", "html": "<p>You must be 18 or over to book for yourself. Sessions for minors (13-17) must be booked by a parent or legal guardian, who will sign our consent forms.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Who can use Talk Space", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "terms-payment", "html": "<p>Fees are shown on our pricing page and confirmed before your session. Payment is taken only after your session is confirmed. Sliding-scale slots are limited and awarded at our discretion.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Sessions and payment", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "terms-cancellations", "html": "<p>You can reschedule up to 24 hours before your session at no charge. Please see our cancellation and refund policy for the full detail.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Cancellations and refunds", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "terms-responsibilities", "html": "<p>You agree to give accurate information at booking, to attend sessions in an environment where you feel safe and undisturbed, and to not record sessions without your therapist''s consent.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Your responsibilities", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "terms-liability", "html": "<p>Talk Space provides counselling but cannot guarantee specific outcomes. Our liability for loss arising from use of the service is limited to fees paid in the twelve months before the event giving rise to the claim.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Limitation of liability", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "terms-law", "html": "<p>These terms are governed by the laws of the Federal Republic of Nigeria. Disputes are subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Lagos State.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Governing law", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}]}, "body_html": null, "source_id": 1785814955397, "updated_at": "2026-08-22T02:43:16.805084+00:00", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null, "author_name": null, "imported_at": "2026-08-04T03:42:35.397+00:00", "excerpt_html": "<p>The terms that govern your use of Talk Space Counselling Services.</p>", "published_at": "2026-08-22T02:43:16.715+00:00", "source_status": "publish", "canonical_path": "/terms", "source_modified_at": "2026-08-04T03:42:35.397+00:00", "featured_media_path": null, "scheduled_publish_at": null, "scheduled_unpublish_at": null}', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-22 02:43:16.805084+00'),
	('c1b25606-0030-47b9-8171-9906dd25c678', 'content_entry', '747f37af-0065-492d-b198-b64142e06542', 'update', '{"id": "747f37af-0065-492d-b198-b64142e06542", "kind": "page", "slug": "cancellation-refund-policy", "title": "Cancellation & refund policy", "metadata": {"sections": [{"id": "cancel-hero", "body": "Last updated: 1 January 2026", "type": "hero", "align": "left", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "links": [], "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "Legal", "heading": "Cancellation & refund policy", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "page", "headingAfter": "", "headingEmphasis": ""}, {"id": "cancel-intro", "html": "<p>We hold your therapist''s time exclusively for you. This policy helps us keep fees affordable while respecting our clinicians'' schedules. Where life gets in the way, please just tell us, we are humans first.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "cancel-table", "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>When you tell us</th><th>Fee</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>More than 24 hours before</td><td>No charge</td><td>Reschedule or cancel freely from your booking link.</td></tr><tr><td>Less than 24 hours before</td><td>50% of the session fee</td><td>Your therapist''s time is already committed.</td></tr><tr><td>No-show</td><td>Full session fee</td><td>Tell us if something urgent happened, we review case by case.</td></tr><tr><td>Cancelled by Talk Space</td><td>Full refund or free reschedule</td><td>We will offer the next available slot with your therapist.</td></tr></tbody></table>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Notice and fees", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "cancel-plans", "html": "<p>For multi-session plans, unused sessions are refundable within 60 days of purchase, pro-rated at the single-session rate. Refunds are processed within 7 working days to the original payment method.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Refunds on plans", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "cancel-groups", "html": "<p>Group fees are refundable in full up to 7 days before the cohort begins. After that, we can transfer your place to the next cohort but cannot refund the fee, as facilitator time and materials are committed.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Group cohorts", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "cancel-ask", "html": "<p>If a fee has been applied that you would like to discuss, please email hello@talkspace.ng or <a href=\"/contact\">contact us</a>. We review every request individually.</p>", "type": "richText", "align": "left", "width": "narrow", "hidden": false, "heading": "Ask us anything", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}]}, "body_html": null, "source_id": 1785948865416, "updated_at": "2026-08-22T02:43:17.243457+00:00", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null, "author_name": null, "imported_at": "2026-08-05T16:54:25.416+00:00", "excerpt_html": "<p>How cancellations, reschedules and refunds work at Talk Space.</p>", "published_at": "2026-08-22T02:43:17.166+00:00", "source_status": "publish", "canonical_path": "/cancellation-refund-policy", "source_modified_at": "2026-08-05T16:54:25.416+00:00", "featured_media_path": null, "scheduled_publish_at": null, "scheduled_unpublish_at": null}', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-22 02:43:17.243457+00'),
	('39fb48ad-be5e-401c-ada3-66c4b997e7e3', 'content_entry', '60559e06-4bc7-4ad5-b89c-5cbaa706a343', 'update', '{"id": "60559e06-4bc7-4ad5-b89c-5cbaa706a343", "kind": "page", "slug": "emergency-support", "title": "Emergency support", "metadata": {"sections": [{"id": "emergency-banner", "body": "If you or someone you know is in immediate danger, use the numbers on this page. If life is at immediate risk, dial 112 and stay on the line.", "type": "callout", "align": "left", "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "bullets": [], "eyebrow": "Important", "heading": "Talk Space is not an emergency service.", "spacing": "md", "surface": "deep"}, {"id": "emergency-hero", "body": "These Nigerian crisis lines are free, confidential and answered by trained responders.", "type": "hero", "align": "left", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "links": [{"id": "emergency-112", "href": "tel:112", "label": "Call 112", "variant": "primary"}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "Emergency support", "heading": "If you or someone you know is in immediate danger,", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "page", "headingAfter": ".", "headingEmphasis": "call for help now"}, {"id": "emergency-lines", "body": "", "type": "cardGrid", "align": "left", "cards": [{"id": "line-112", "body": "Police, ambulance, fire and rescue.", "href": "tel:112", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Nigeria Emergency Services", "bullets": [], "tagline": "112 · 24 hours, 7 days a week", "linkLabel": "Call 112"}, {"id": "line-mani", "body": "Mental health crisis and emotional distress.", "href": "tel:+2348092106493", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Mentally Aware Nigeria (MANI)", "bullets": [], "tagline": "0809 210 6493 · 24 hours, 7 days a week", "linkLabel": "Call MANI"}, {"id": "line-surpin", "body": "Suicide prevention and crisis intervention.", "href": "tel:+2348062106493", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Suicide Research and Prevention Initiative (SURPIN)", "bullets": [], "tagline": "0806 210 6493 or 0809 210 6493 · 24 hours, 7 days a week", "linkLabel": "Call SURPIN"}, {"id": "line-dsva", "body": "Domestic violence, sexual assault and abuse support.", "href": "tel:+2348137960048", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Lagos State Domestic and Sexual Violence Agency", "bullets": [], "tagline": "0813 796 0048 · 24 hours, 7 days a week", "linkLabel": "Call DSVA"}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "columns": 2, "eyebrow": "Crisis lines", "heading": "Free, confidential, 24/7.", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "emergency-expect", "body": "", "type": "cardGrid", "align": "left", "cards": [{"id": "expect-call", "body": "Dial the number that matches your situation. All calls are free.", "href": "", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Pick up the phone", "bullets": [], "tagline": "", "linkLabel": ""}, {"id": "expect-responder", "body": "A trained crisis responder will listen, assess and guide you to safety.", "href": "", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Speak to a responder", "bullets": [], "tagline": "", "linkLabel": ""}, {"id": "expect-confidential", "body": "Crisis lines do not share your identity or details without your consent.", "href": "", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Your call is confidential", "bullets": [], "tagline": "", "linkLabel": ""}, {"id": "expect-stay", "body": "If life is at immediate risk, call 112 and stay on the line until help arrives.", "href": "", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Stay on the line", "bullets": [], "tagline": "", "linkLabel": ""}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "columns": 4, "eyebrow": "What to expect", "heading": "Calling a crisis line.", "spacing": "md", "surface": "cream"}, {"id": "emergency-cta", "body": "Talk Space offers confidential counselling for what comes next.", "type": "cta", "align": "center", "links": [{"id": "emergency-cta-book", "href": "/book", "label": "Book a session", "variant": "primary"}, {"id": "emergency-cta-contact", "href": "/contact", "label": "Talk to us first", "variant": "outline"}], "width": "content", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "", "heading": "When the crisis has passed, we are here.", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "cream"}]}, "body_html": null, "source_id": 1785948865515, "updated_at": "2026-08-22T02:43:17.716087+00:00", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null, "author_name": null, "imported_at": "2026-08-05T16:54:25.515+00:00", "excerpt_html": "<p>Talk Space is not an emergency service. Use these Nigerian crisis lines if you are in danger.</p>", "published_at": "2026-08-22T02:43:17.639+00:00", "source_status": "publish", "canonical_path": "/emergency-support", "source_modified_at": "2026-08-05T16:54:25.515+00:00", "featured_media_path": null, "scheduled_publish_at": null, "scheduled_unpublish_at": null}', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-22 02:43:17.716087+00'),
	('bb78fa4f-6bf0-4704-bc90-24b90cfb6d37', 'content_entry', 'd14ff633-8d51-4309-8b29-391aa53752bb', 'update', '{"id": "d14ff633-8d51-4309-8b29-391aa53752bb", "kind": "page", "slug": "faqs", "title": "Frequently asked questions", "metadata": {"sections": [{"id": "faqs-hero", "body": "Everything clients usually ask before a first session. If your question is not here, message us and we will answer it directly.", "type": "hero", "align": "center", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "links": [{"id": "faqs-hero-contact", "href": "/contact", "label": "Ask us a question", "variant": "outline"}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "FAQs", "heading": "Questions, answered", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "cream", "headingAfter": ".", "headingEmphasis": "honestly"}, {"id": "faqs-live", "body": "", "type": "faqList", "align": "left", "width": "content", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "", "heading": "", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "faqs-cta", "body": "Book a confidential session, or send us a question first.", "type": "cta", "align": "center", "links": [{"id": "faqs-cta-book", "href": "/book", "label": "Book a session", "variant": "primary"}, {"id": "faqs-cta-contact", "href": "/contact", "label": "Talk to us first", "variant": "outline"}], "width": "content", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "", "heading": "Ready when you are.", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "cream"}]}, "body_html": null, "source_id": 1785948865614, "updated_at": "2026-08-22T02:43:18.207104+00:00", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null, "author_name": null, "imported_at": "2026-08-05T16:54:25.614+00:00", "excerpt_html": "<p>Answers about confidentiality, matching, online versus in-person sessions, fees and more.</p>", "published_at": "2026-08-22T02:43:18.128+00:00", "source_status": "publish", "canonical_path": "/faqs", "source_modified_at": "2026-08-05T16:54:25.614+00:00", "featured_media_path": null, "scheduled_publish_at": null, "scheduled_unpublish_at": null}', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-22 02:43:18.207104+00'),
	('cf2df642-e574-4d77-b455-f81af37098bb', 'content_entry', '89cfebd0-3ae9-475f-8d77-3666f40d8d8a', 'update', '{"id": "89cfebd0-3ae9-475f-8d77-3666f40d8d8a", "kind": "page", "slug": "about", "title": "About Talk Space", "metadata": {"sections": [{"id": "about-hero", "body": "Talk Space Counselling Services is a Nigerian practice of licensed therapists offering confidential online and in-person support for individuals, couples, families and teens.", "type": "hero", "align": "left", "image": {"alt": "Talk Space therapists and clients", "src": "asset:ts-hero-people"}, "links": [{"id": "about-hero-book", "href": "/book", "label": "Book a session", "variant": "primary"}, {"id": "about-hero-team", "href": "/therapists", "label": "Meet the therapists", "variant": "outline"}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "About", "heading": "Therapy that feels human, professional and", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "cream", "headingAfter": ".", "headingEmphasis": "close to home"}, {"id": "about-values", "body": "", "type": "cardGrid", "align": "left", "cards": [{"id": "about-value-confidential", "body": "Everything you share is private, protected and used only to help you.", "href": "", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Confidential by design", "bullets": [], "tagline": "", "linkLabel": ""}, {"id": "about-value-cultural", "body": "Therapists who understand family, faith, work and community in Nigeria.", "href": "", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Culturally grounded", "bullets": [], "tagline": "", "linkLabel": ""}, {"id": "about-value-care", "body": "We meet you where you are, no jargon, no judgement, no rush.", "href": "", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Care over cure", "bullets": [], "tagline": "", "linkLabel": ""}, {"id": "about-value-evidence", "body": "CBT, ACT, EMDR, systemic and relational modalities, chosen for you.", "href": "", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Evidence-based", "bullets": [], "tagline": "", "linkLabel": ""}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "columns": 4, "eyebrow": "Our values", "heading": "Four commitments we hold every session.", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "about-story", "body": "Talk Space began in 2017 with a simple observation: too many people in Nigeria who wanted therapy either could not find a therapist they trusted, could not afford the ones they did find, or were held back by stigma.\n\nToday, our care coordinators match hundreds of clients each month with licensed therapists, online across Nigeria, and in person at our rooms in Gbagada, Lagos. We keep our fees transparent, hold a limited number of sliding-scale slots, and never take payment until your session is confirmed.\n\nIf you are considering therapy for the first time, you are welcome here. The first conversation is often the hardest, and the most important.", "type": "hero", "align": "left", "image": {"alt": "Talk Space therapist seated in a counselling room", "src": "content-media/therapists/2026/08/b17cf861-9ef993a5-750797197-1617088680024620-7808186723757096404-n-13.jpg"}, "links": [], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "Our story", "heading": "Built in Lagos. Made for anywhere you are.", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page", "headingAfter": "", "headingEmphasis": ""}, {"id": "about-cta", "body": "Book a confidential session with a licensed Nigerian therapist, online or in person.", "type": "cta", "align": "center", "links": [{"id": "about-cta-book", "href": "/book", "label": "Book a session", "variant": "primary"}, {"id": "about-cta-contact", "href": "/contact", "label": "Talk to us first", "variant": "outline"}], "width": "content", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "", "heading": "Your healing starts with one conversation.", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "cream"}]}, "body_html": null, "source_id": 1785814665382, "updated_at": "2026-08-22T02:44:45.559799+00:00", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null, "author_name": null, "imported_at": "2026-08-04T03:37:45.382+00:00", "excerpt_html": "<p>A Nigerian practice of licensed therapists offering confidential online and in-person counselling.</p>", "published_at": "2026-08-22T02:44:45.468+00:00", "source_status": "publish", "canonical_path": "/about", "source_modified_at": "2026-08-04T03:37:45.382+00:00", "featured_media_path": null, "scheduled_publish_at": null, "scheduled_unpublish_at": null}', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-22 02:44:45.559799+00'),
	('ebf71572-5de8-4af8-a69a-044dcc81dc20', 'content_entry', '2101359f-f27e-4ef0-b021-f4ea7a822d43', 'update', '{"id": "2101359f-f27e-4ef0-b021-f4ea7a822d43", "kind": "page", "slug": "services", "title": "Our services", "metadata": {"sections": [{"id": "services-hero", "body": "Every Talk Space service is delivered by a licensed Nigerian therapist. Choose the format that fits, or ask us and we will recommend one after a short conversation.", "type": "hero", "align": "center", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "links": [{"id": "services-hero-book", "href": "/book", "label": "Book a session", "variant": "primary"}, {"id": "services-hero-price", "href": "/pricing", "label": "See pricing", "variant": "outline"}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "Our services", "heading": "Care shaped around the", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "cream", "headingAfter": "in front of us.", "headingEmphasis": "person"}, {"id": "services-gallery", "type": "gallery", "align": "left", "width": "full", "hidden": false, "images": [{"id": "gal-svc-clarity", "alt": "African care team discussing a counselling intake plan", "src": "asset:african-team", "caption": "Clarity Call"}, {"id": "gal-svc-individual", "alt": "A Nigerian therapist and client in a warm one-to-one counselling session", "src": "asset:individual-therapy", "caption": "Individual Therapy"}, {"id": "gal-svc-couple", "alt": "A young African couple holding hands during a couples therapy session", "src": "asset:couples-therapy", "caption": "Couple Therapy"}, {"id": "gal-svc-organizational", "alt": "African professionals in a calm workplace counselling conversation", "src": "asset:african-team", "caption": "Organizational Counselling"}, {"id": "gal-svc-premarital", "alt": "An African couple in a calm counselling conversation", "src": "asset:ts-marriage-couple", "caption": "Premarital Counselling"}, {"id": "gal-svc-infidelity", "alt": "An African couple in a serious counselling conversation", "src": "asset:african-couch", "caption": "Infidelity Recovery Therapy"}, {"id": "gal-svc-teen", "alt": "An African family seated together in a warm home setting", "src": "asset:family-therapy", "caption": "Teen/Child Therapy"}, {"id": "gal-svc-family", "alt": "A small group of African adults in a circle in a family therapy session", "src": "asset:group-therapy", "caption": "Family Therapy"}], "heading": "", "spacing": "sm", "surface": "cream", "speedSeconds": 50}, {"id": "services-list", "body": "", "type": "featureList", "align": "left", "cards": [{"id": "svc-clarity", "body": "A short paid consultation for clients who want help choosing the right service, understanding next steps, or asking a focused question before booking therapy.", "href": "/book", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "African care team discussing a counselling intake plan", "src": "asset:african-team"}, "title": "Clarity Call", "bullets": ["15-minute online or phone consultation", "Best for fit, direction and next-step guidance", "Not a full therapy session or emergency support"], "tagline": "A focused 15-minute first step.", "linkLabel": "Book a clarity call"}, {"id": "svc-individual", "body": "For anxiety, depression, burnout, grief, self-esteem, identity and life transitions. Weekly or fortnightly 50-minute sessions with the same therapist throughout.", "href": "/book", "tone": "dark", "image": {"alt": "A Nigerian therapist and client in a warm one-to-one counselling session", "src": "asset:individual-therapy"}, "title": "Individual Therapy", "bullets": ["CBT, ACT, psychodynamic and integrative approaches", "Online video or in-person at our Lagos rooms", "Free 15-minute intro call available on request"], "tagline": "One-to-one support, at your pace.", "linkLabel": "Book individual therapy"}, {"id": "svc-couple", "body": "For couples navigating conflict, communication, intimacy, parenting differences, trust issues, or the pressure of repeated unresolved arguments.", "href": "/book", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "A young African couple holding hands during a couples therapy session", "src": "asset:couples-therapy"}, "title": "Couple Therapy", "bullets": ["Emotion-focused and Gottman-informed approaches", "75-minute sessions with a relational therapist", "Individual check-ins available alongside joint sessions"], "tagline": "For the relationship you want to keep growing.", "linkLabel": "Book couple therapy"}, {"id": "svc-organizational", "body": "For organisations that want confidential employee support, workplace wellness sessions, leadership coaching, and practical care for burnout, stress and team conflict.", "href": "/contact", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "African professionals in a calm workplace counselling conversation", "src": "asset:african-team"}, "title": "Organizational Counselling", "bullets": ["EAP-style individual support for staff", "Team wellness sessions and psychoeducation", "Workplace conflict, burnout and leadership support"], "tagline": "Mental health support for healthier teams.", "linkLabel": "Talk to our team"}, {"id": "svc-premarital", "body": "Structured sessions for engaged or seriously committed partners who want to explore expectations, communication, family systems, faith, finances and shared values before marriage.", "href": "/book", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "An African couple in a calm counselling conversation", "src": "asset:ts-marriage-couple"}, "title": "Premarital Counselling", "bullets": ["Communication, conflict and expectation mapping", "Values, finances, family boundaries and intimacy", "Personal and couple profiling where appropriate"], "tagline": "Prepare for marriage with clarity and care.", "linkLabel": "Book premarital counselling"}, {"id": "svc-infidelity", "body": "Compassionate therapy for individuals or couples processing betrayal, disclosure, grief, anger, repair, boundaries, and decisions about whether and how to rebuild trust.", "href": "/book", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "An African couple in a serious counselling conversation", "src": "asset:african-couch"}, "title": "Infidelity Recovery Therapy", "bullets": ["Stabilise emotions and reduce repeated conflict", "Process betrayal, disclosure and repair conversations", "Rebuild trust or make clear decisions with support"], "tagline": "Structured support after betrayal.", "linkLabel": "Book infidelity recovery"}, {"id": "svc-teen", "body": "Support for children and adolescents experiencing behavioural concerns, anxiety, school-related stress, emotional regulation challenges or family transitions.", "href": "/book", "tone": "dark", "image": {"alt": "An African family seated together in a warm home setting", "src": "asset:family-therapy"}, "title": "Teen/Child Therapy", "bullets": ["Behavioural, play-informed and art-informed therapy", "Parent guidance and family collaboration", "Age-appropriate care from specialist clinicians"], "tagline": "Specialist care for younger clients.", "linkLabel": "Book teen or child therapy"}, {"id": "svc-family", "body": "For families navigating conflict, sibling rivalry, blended households, elder care tension, parenting differences or major life transitions.", "href": "/book", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "A small group of African adults in a circle in a family therapy session", "src": "asset:group-therapy"}, "title": "Family Therapy", "bullets": ["Systemic and structural family therapy", "Support for intergenerational relationships", "Sessions include the members most affected"], "tagline": "Bring the whole system into the room.", "linkLabel": "Book family therapy"}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "", "heading": "", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "services-cta", "body": "Book a clarity call and we will recommend the right starting point.", "type": "cta", "align": "center", "links": [{"id": "services-cta-book", "href": "/book", "label": "Book a session", "variant": "primary"}, {"id": "services-cta-contact", "href": "/contact", "label": "Talk to us first", "variant": "outline"}], "width": "content", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "", "heading": "Not sure which service fits?", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "cream"}]}, "body_html": null, "source_id": 1785814681231, "updated_at": "2026-08-22T02:44:46.049994+00:00", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null, "author_name": null, "imported_at": "2026-08-04T03:38:01.231+00:00", "excerpt_html": "<p>Clarity calls, individual, couple, workplace, premarital, infidelity recovery, teen and family counselling.</p>", "published_at": "2026-08-22T02:44:45.958+00:00", "source_status": "publish", "canonical_path": "/services", "source_modified_at": "2026-08-04T03:38:01.231+00:00", "featured_media_path": null, "scheduled_publish_at": null, "scheduled_unpublish_at": null}', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-22 02:44:46.049994+00'),
	('c64a1870-364b-42d3-8589-21c4af4aaeef', 'content_entry', '64b2166f-8092-4de7-8ef0-52d8bffec0b2', 'update', '{"id": "64b2166f-8092-4de7-8ef0-52d8bffec0b2", "kind": "page", "slug": "therapists", "title": "Therapists", "metadata": {"sections": [{"id": "therapists-hero", "body": "Every Talk Space therapist is licensed to practise in Nigeria and holds training in psychology, counselling or a related clinical field. Our care coordinators match you with the therapist whose training and style best fit.", "type": "hero", "align": "center", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "links": [{"id": "therapists-hero-book", "href": "/book", "label": "Request a session", "variant": "primary"}, {"id": "therapists-hero-contact", "href": "/contact", "label": "Ask for a match", "variant": "outline"}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "Meet the team", "heading": "Licensed, warm, and", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "cream", "headingAfter": ".", "headingEmphasis": "quietly excellent"}, {"id": "therapists-live", "body": "", "type": "therapistList", "align": "left", "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "", "heading": "", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "therapists-cta", "body": "Beyond the profiles above, Talk Space partners with a vetted network of licensed therapists across Nigeria.", "type": "cta", "align": "center", "links": [{"id": "therapists-cta-book", "href": "/book", "label": "Book a session", "variant": "primary"}, {"id": "therapists-cta-contact", "href": "/contact", "label": "Talk to us first", "variant": "outline"}], "width": "content", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "", "heading": "More clinicians, matched to you on request.", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "cream"}]}, "body_html": null, "source_id": 1787366594983, "updated_at": "2026-08-22T02:44:46.510394+00:00", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null, "author_name": null, "imported_at": "2026-08-22T02:43:14.983+00:00", "excerpt_html": "<p>Meet Talk Space''s licensed Nigerian therapists and counsellors, with online and in-person support.</p>", "published_at": "2026-08-22T02:44:46.411+00:00", "source_status": "publish", "canonical_path": "/therapists", "source_modified_at": "2026-08-22T02:43:14.983+00:00", "featured_media_path": null, "scheduled_publish_at": null, "scheduled_unpublish_at": null}', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-22 02:44:46.510394+00'),
	('b544441e-41d2-465a-ae4c-3e6a89ef4240', 'content_entry', 'c67aa275-f65b-49b3-aa19-bb3e164da620', 'update', '{"id": "c67aa275-f65b-49b3-aa19-bb3e164da620", "kind": "page", "slug": "pricing", "title": "Pricing", "metadata": {"sections": [{"id": "pricing-hero", "body": "Transparent fees for individuals, couples and families in Nigeria and the diaspora. Payments are processed securely.", "type": "hero", "align": "left", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "links": [{"id": "pricing-hero-book", "href": "/book", "label": "Start secure booking", "variant": "primary"}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "Affordable therapy plans", "heading": "Professional counselling —", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "cream", "headingAfter": ".", "headingEmphasis": "accessible"}, {"id": "pricing-single", "body": "Best for first appointments, focused support, or clients who prefer to book one session at a time.", "type": "cardGrid", "align": "left", "cards": [{"id": "price-clarity", "body": "A short paid call to choose the right service, ask a focused question, or plan your next step.", "href": "/contact", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Clarity Call", "bullets": ["15-minute online or phone call", "Service-fit guidance", "Clear next-step recommendation", "Not a full therapy session"], "tagline": "Contact for pricing · per 15-minute consultation", "linkLabel": "Request a call"}, {"id": "price-individual", "body": "One-to-one online counselling tailored to your current concerns and treatment goals.", "href": "/book?service=individual&mode=online", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Individual Therapy", "bullets": ["Online video session", "CBT-informed support", "Mindfulness and solution-focused tools", "Personalised next steps after session"], "tagline": "₦55,000 · per 60-minute session", "linkLabel": "Start secure booking"}, {"id": "price-couple", "body": "Structured couple therapy for communication, trust repair, conflict and emotional intimacy.", "href": "/book?service=couple&mode=online", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Couple Therapy", "bullets": ["Online video session", "Couple assessment and profiling", "Communication and conflict skills", "Infidelity-sensitive support when needed"], "tagline": "₦90,000 · per 90-minute session", "linkLabel": "Start secure booking"}, {"id": "price-teen", "body": "Specialist support for children and adolescents, with age-appropriate therapeutic methods.", "href": "/contact", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Child/Teen Therapy", "bullets": ["Behavioural and emotional support", "School-related concerns", "Play, art and talk therapy methods", "Parent guidance where appropriate"], "tagline": "₦50,000 · per 60-minute session", "linkLabel": "Request a slot"}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "columns": 4, "eyebrow": "Single sessions", "heading": "Pay per session.", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "pricing-in-person", "body": "For clients who prefer face-to-face support. In-person sessions are available by appointment.", "type": "cardGrid", "align": "left", "cards": [{"id": "price-in-person-individual", "body": "One-to-one counselling in a private Talk Space room, tailored to your treatment goals.", "href": "/book?service=individual&mode=in_person", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Individual In-person Session", "bullets": ["Physical session by appointment", "Private counselling room", "CBT-informed support", "Personalised next steps after session"], "tagline": "₦85,000 · per 60-minute session", "linkLabel": "Start secure booking"}, {"id": "price-in-person-couple", "body": "Face-to-face couple therapy for communication, trust repair, conflict and intimacy.", "href": "/book?service=couple&mode=in_person", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Couple In-person Session", "bullets": ["Physical couple session", "Couple assessment and profiling", "Communication and conflict skills", "Infidelity-sensitive support when needed"], "tagline": "₦130,000 · per 90-minute session", "linkLabel": "Start secure booking"}, {"id": "price-in-person-month-individual", "body": "Four face-to-face individual therapy sessions with the same therapist.", "href": "/book?service=one_month_individual&mode=in_person", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "One-Month Individual In-person", "bullets": ["Four physical sessions", "Consistent therapist match", "Progress tracking between sessions", "Structured short-course care"], "tagline": "₦323,000 · 4 individual sessions monthly", "linkLabel": "Start secure booking"}, {"id": "price-in-person-month-couple", "body": "A structured month of in-person couple therapy for reconnection and repair.", "href": "/book?service=one_month_couple&mode=in_person", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "One-Month Couple In-person", "bullets": ["Four physical couple sessions", "Assessment-led treatment plan", "Communication and intimacy work", "Support for recurring conflict cycles"], "tagline": "₦494,000 · 4 couple sessions monthly", "linkLabel": "Start secure booking"}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "columns": 4, "eyebrow": "In-person sessions", "heading": "Physical sessions at our rooms.", "spacing": "md", "surface": "cream"}, {"id": "pricing-monthly", "body": "Four-session plans for clients who want rhythm, continuity and a clearer therapeutic arc.", "type": "cardGrid", "align": "left", "cards": [{"id": "price-month-individual", "body": "A focused month of individual therapy with the same therapist and structured follow-up.", "href": "/book?service=one_month_individual&mode=online", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Individual Plan", "bullets": ["Four online sessions", "Consistent therapist match", "Progress tracking between sessions", "Most affordable individual route"], "tagline": "₦210,000 · 4 individual sessions monthly", "linkLabel": "Start secure booking"}, {"id": "price-month-couple", "body": "A structured month of couple therapy for communication, reconnection and repair.", "href": "/book?service=one_month_couple&mode=online", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Couple Plan", "bullets": ["Four online couple sessions", "Assessment-led treatment plan", "Communication and intimacy work", "Support for recurring conflict cycles"], "tagline": "₦342,000 · 4 couple sessions monthly", "linkLabel": "Start secure booking"}, {"id": "price-month-premarital", "body": "Guided sessions for engaged or seriously committed partners preparing for marriage.", "href": "/contact", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Premarital Plan", "bullets": ["Communication and expectations", "Family systems and in-law conversations", "Finance, faith and shared values", "Personalised couple recommendations"], "tagline": "Contact for pricing · structured premarital package", "linkLabel": "Ask for package"}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "columns": 3, "eyebrow": "Monthly packages", "heading": "Commit to a short course of care.", "spacing": "md", "surface": "cream"}, {"id": "pricing-specialized", "body": "Specialist support for deeper therapeutic work, relationship repair and workplace wellbeing.", "type": "cardGrid", "align": "left", "cards": [{"id": "price-psychotherapy", "body": "Longer-term therapy for trauma, complex grief and deeper psychological work.", "href": "/contact", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Psychotherapy", "bullets": ["Trauma-informed practice", "Longer therapeutic arc", "Regular clinical review", "Referral support where needed"], "tagline": "Contact for pricing · extended therapeutic work", "linkLabel": "Discuss psychotherapy"}, {"id": "price-infidelity", "body": "Structured support after betrayal, for individuals or couples deciding how to move forward.", "href": "/contact", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Infidelity Recovery", "bullets": ["Stabilise conflict and emotion", "Guided disclosure conversations", "Trust repair or clear decisions", "Individual and joint sessions"], "tagline": "Contact for pricing · structured recovery package", "linkLabel": "Ask about recovery"}, {"id": "price-organizational", "body": "Confidential employee support, wellness sessions and leadership coaching for teams.", "href": "/contact", "tone": "default", "image": {"alt": "", "src": ""}, "title": "Organizational Counselling", "bullets": ["EAP-style staff support", "Team wellness sessions", "Burnout and conflict support", "Reporting on uptake, never on identities"], "tagline": "Contact for pricing · per organisation, scoped to need", "linkLabel": "Request a proposal"}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "columns": 3, "eyebrow": "Specialized packages", "heading": "Care for complex or specialist needs.", "spacing": "md", "surface": "page"}, {"id": "pricing-note", "body": "Sliding-scale slots are limited and awarded at our discretion. If cost is a barrier, tell us and we will look at the options with you.", "type": "callout", "align": "left", "width": "content", "hidden": false, "bullets": ["No payment is taken until your appointment is confirmed", "Reschedule free of charge up to 24 hours before your session", "Multi-session plans are refundable pro-rata within 60 days"], "eyebrow": "Good to know", "heading": "Fees are always confirmed before your session.", "spacing": "md", "surface": "deep"}, {"id": "pricing-faq", "body": "", "type": "faq", "align": "left", "items": [{"id": "payment-timing", "answer": "Payments are processed securely via Paystack when you book. If you need to reschedule or cancel, do so at least 48 hours in advance.", "question": "When is payment taken?"}, {"id": "payment-methods", "answer": "Card (Visa, Mastercard, Verve), bank transfer and USSD via Paystack. Corporate invoicing is available for HR-sponsored programmes.", "question": "What payment methods do you accept?"}, {"id": "diaspora-pricing", "answer": "Yes. USD equivalents are shown for each plan and you can pay in either currency via Paystack.", "question": "Do you offer diaspora pricing?"}, {"id": "package-booking", "answer": "Yes. Our one-month plans (four sessions) are the most affordable way to commit to a short course of therapy.", "question": "Can I book a package rather than pay per session?"}], "width": "wide", "hidden": false, "eyebrow": "Billing FAQ", "heading": "Common questions about fees.", "spacing": "lg", "surface": "page"}]}, "body_html": null, "source_id": 1785815591914, "updated_at": "2026-08-22T02:44:46.951673+00:00", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null, "author_name": null, "imported_at": "2026-08-04T03:53:11.914+00:00", "excerpt_html": "<p>Transparent counselling fees for individuals, couples and families in Nigeria and the diaspora.</p>", "published_at": "2026-08-22T02:44:46.858+00:00", "source_status": "publish", "canonical_path": "/pricing", "source_modified_at": "2026-08-04T03:53:11.914+00:00", "featured_media_path": null, "scheduled_publish_at": null, "scheduled_unpublish_at": null}', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-22 02:44:46.951673+00'),
